      "id": "evt_shared_debts",
      "name": "The Master's Shared Tally",
      "description": "Years ago, the sword master settled a feud by recording obligations owed across clan lines instead of naming a victor. Each sect accepted one notch, though none agreed on what the whole tally meant.",
