      "name": "The Price of a Sponsor",
      "description": "The Mothkeepers possess a wing-mark that could prove the error, but will not present it without a sponsor. The Landing Petitioners can force a hearing, yet their customary witnesses risk revealing memories they have kept from their own accounts.",
      "faction_ids": [
